<title>SPAIN: Spain's Promociones Eurobuilding trade suspended.</title>
<headline>Spain's Promociones Eurobuilding trade suspended.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish stock market commission CMNV said on Friday it was suspending trade in property firm Promociones Eurobuilding due to possible bids to buy Madrid's Hotel Eurobuilding.</p>
<p>Promociones Eurobuilding is traded on Madrid's stock market floor. It was not traded on Thursday, but ended 1996 at 520 pesetas after rising over 57 percent in less than one month.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
